<view class="lx-page"><field-nav/><view class="lx-content"><view class="lx-kicker">MY FIELD</view><view class="lx-title">我的场域</view><view class="lx-subtitle">所有已交换内容都能从这里继续打开；不需要再次付款，也不必重新寻找。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="lx-loading">正在同步权益…</view><block wx:else><view class="archive-tools lx-veil"><input value="{{query}}" placeholder="搜索已购报告、叙事或修炼" bindinput="onSearch"/><view wx:if="{{query}}" class="clear-search" bindtap="clearSearch">清除</view></view><view class="quick-links"><button class="quick-link" bindtap="explore">探索场域精测</button><button class="quick-link" bindtap="narratives">浏览多维叙事</button></view><view class="lx-section"><view class="lx-section-title">生命档案与已开启内容</view><view wx:if="{{!filteredOrders.length}}" class="lx-empty lx-veil">尚未找到已购内容。<br/>可前往场域精测或多维叙事继续探索。</view><view wx:for="{{filteredOrders}}" wx:key="id" class="lx-card lx-veil order" data-order="{{item}}" bindtap="openOrder"><view class="lx-card-title">{{item.submission_name || item.productName}}</view><view class="lx-card-note">权益已开启 · {{item.paidLabel}}</view><view class="arrow">{{opening === item.id ? '正在安全打开…' : item.submission_id ? '打开完整档案 →' : '继续阅读 / 进入 →'}}</view></view></view><view class="lx-section"><view class="lx-section-title">长期与订阅权益</view><view wx:if="{{!filteredUnlocks.length}}" class="lx-card lx-veil"><view class="lx-card-note">目前没有单独的订阅权益。</view></view><view wx:for="{{filteredUnlocks}}" wx:key="product_id" class="benefit lx-veil" data-unlock="{{item}}" bindtap="openUnlock"><view>{{item.productName || item.product_id}}</view><view class="benefit-date">{{opening === item.product_id ? '正在安全打开…' : item.expiryLabel + ' · 打开 →'}}</view></view></view><view class="lx-section"><view class="lx-section-title">账号连接</view><view class="lx-card lx-veil"><view class="lx-card-note">小程序身份已经安全建立。打开完整档案时会以同一身份进入灵犀场，不需要再次注册或输入密码。</view></view></view></block></view></view>
